{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Internet culture!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game mocks new and old internet culture by making enemies that represent the worst of their subculture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dodge and hit!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you perfectly dodge a attack you counterattack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345590/extras/DodgeAndHit.gif?t=1746253036\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gradual HP loss for you and enemies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">if your HP is red, do not panic! you can heal yourself if your HP is not 0, but enemies can so do that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345590/extras/HealRed.gif?t=1746253036\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Without pretentious themes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We know these type of games, so we decided not using pretentious themes!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3345590?t=1746253036","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3345590?t=1746253036","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345590/dad4f2a9247de2300e8da0970458c72f60fd5e8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746253036","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345590/dad4f2a9247de2300e8da0970458c72f60fd5e8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746253036","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Shar